<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our common stock is listed
on the Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol &#8220;SBFM.&#8221; We do not intend to apply for listing of the Pre-Funded Warrants or
