<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">We are being represented by Sichenzia
Ross Ference Carmel LLP, New York, New York, with respect to certain legal matters as to United States federal securities and New York
state law. The enforceability of the warrants will be passed upon for us by Sichenzia Ross Ference Carmel LLP, New York, New York. The
validity of the securities offered hereby will be passed upon for us by Hart &amp; Hart, LLC, Denver, CO. The placement agent is being
represented by Kaufman &amp; Canoles, P.C., Richmond, VA, in connection with this offering.</p>
